2050,EQ ID 2050,PMU Rivet Gun #12,Assembly,12743,08/14/2024,1. Prod Stopped,not working,Closed and Completed,0,1,Preston,Maintenance,0,08/14/2024 12:00 PM,Preston Ellexson - 08/15/24 12:31:24 PM: Took gun apart and inspected. Mandrel guide in top back of gun was broken. It had fallen down into the piston rod return spring. Got removed and put back together. Pulling head adapter was unthreaded too. Cleaned and put back together with red Loctite. Replaced jaw pusher spring too. Tested with no issues. Popping rivet in one hit.,[]
