225,EQ ID 225,Vendor Spotwelder KVA-30 (#11175),Assembly,7935,11/07/2023,1. Prod Stopped,welder not working mabey a mother board,Closed and Completed,0,0.5,Preston,Maintenance,0,11/07/2023 07:00 AM,"Preston Ellexson - 11/07/23  5:11:01 AM: Error 14 when machine is powered on. When you switch to operate or program, no buttons work after that. Swapped the board with a used board from a decommissioned machine. Turned on with no errors. Reset all schedules and extended schedules saved on board. Set one weld schedule, tested, and everything is welding good with no errors. Awaiting a quote on new boards. We have one more used board, but I'm not certain it is usable.",[]
