234,EQ ID 234,Stand-Up Forklift #2,Assembly,4533,02/22/2023,"5. Prod Ongoing, Maint Required","The deadman brake is failing, and the switch in the joystick is also failing.",Closed and Completed,0,5,Preston/James @ Medley,Maintenance,0,03/10/2023 10:30 AM,"Preston Ellexson - 03/10/23 12:30:51 PM: James replaced parts and tested. Lift is running good. Deadman isn't stopping immediately but I will monitor to see if it needs adjusted more next week and let James know. | Preston Ellexson - 02/24/23  8:31:52 AM: Steering wheel and bearings are shot. Ordering new assembly for Medley to install when it arrives. | Preston Ellexson - 02/22/23 12:43:24 PM: One of the two deadman pedal mounting bolts was broken. They are welded on the plate that is welded to the frame. I ground down, drilled and tapped a matching bolt size(M10X1.5). Got all mounted back up and tight. Deadman is not functioning properly. Sounds like we have bearings going out on the drive wheel as well. James @ Medley will be out tomorrow to inspect.",[]
234,EQ ID 234,Stand-Up Forklift #2,Assembly,6269,06/30/2023,"3. Prod Affected, Not Stopped",Need to have service on the forklift to prevent it from not stopping and we need to bring in a forklift rental until forklift is repaired or replaced.,Closed and Completed,0,0.5,Preston,Maintenance,0,06/30/2023 06:30 AM,"Preston Ellexson - 07/05/23  9:59:53 AM: James @ Medley came out and inspected. Lift is working good with no issues other than using the temporary horn. I drove lift as well with no issues at all. Let Dean and Shane know, but lift is back in shipping to use. Rental will be here today so Ryan can use it moving forward until the new forklift arrives. | Preston Ellexson - 06/30/23  4:35:19 AM: Getting in touch with our technician around break time to see what his schedule looks like.",[]
