236,EQ ID 236,Vendor Pem Stud Riveter,Assembly,14148,12/18/2024,"5. Prod Ongoing, Maint Required",machine still works but is hanging up when cycling on the up cycle.,Closed and Completed,0,2,Preston/Derek,Maintenance,0,12/18/2024 12:00 PM,Preston Ellexson - 02/12/25 10:32:04 AM: Had to take apart the front of the machine. Piece was broken. Got all removed and was able to repair the broken part. Put all back together and used white lithium grease on everything. Found a broken bolt on the bottom of the housing. Replaced it with new. Got all put back together and tested. Adjusted the height to where it was pressing the stud in good. Tightened jam nut and machine is running good.,[]
