255,EQ ID 255,Large Trimline TIG Welder Syncrowave 250,Assembly,13120,09/19/2024,1. Prod Stopped,Gun on welder arguing out,Closed and Completed,0,0.75,Preston,Maintenance,0,09/19/2024 08:00 AM,Preston Ellexson - 09/19/24  8:54:06 AM: There was a hole in the tip. I replaced the spot gun head with a used one from maintenance. Put all lines back together inside gun. Tightened all fittings by hand. Whoever took the gun apart last had one of the trigger button wires flattened in between the housing. Stripped wires back and connected push button. Put gun back together and tested. Everything is working good with no issues.,[]
