255,EQ ID 255,Large Trimline TIG Welder Syncrowave 250,Assembly,19880,06/17/2026,1. Prod Stopped,Large Trimline 2 tig gun leaking water,Closed and Completed,0,0.75,Preston/Dennis,Maintenance,0,06/18/2026 01:00 PM,"Dennis Davis - 06/19/26  8:10:17 AM: Incoming water hose kept coming apart from the brass fitting, so we are ordering another and will put it on if needed.
