1742,EQ ID 1742,PMU 2 Spotwelder KVA-30 (#11788),Assembly,1935,07/18/2022,1. Prod Stopped,Machine needs Oil and air check. See Lorena for more information.,Closed and Completed,0,4,Preston,Maintenance,0,07/19/2022 01:00 PM,"Preston Ellexson - 07/19/22 12:06:52 PM: Retract wasn't functioning properly. Removed valves and took to maintenance. Took apart, cleaned, greased up and tested manually. The spool was dry and wasn't shifting right. Got valves put back on machine. Had to adjust the air pressure on both regulators. These require more air pressure than our other spotwelders due to the difference in valves. Had Chris set tips and test weld. Machine is working great.",[]
