1742,EQ ID 1742,PMU 2 Spotwelder KVA-30 (#11788),Assembly,2077,08/03/2022,"3. Prod Affected, Not Stopped",Arm will not come back up after weld.,Closed and Completed,0,0.5,Preston,Maintenance,0,08/03/2022 07:00 AM,Preston Ellexson - 08/03/22  7:56:38 AM: Adjusted the bottom tip holder in a bit. Got a file and cleaned top and bottom tips. Cleaned after that with 80 grit sandpaper. Adjusted some settings on the weld schedule. It is sticking maybe once every door. I'm not sure why it's doing that. I will monitor.,[]
