1750,EQ ID 1750,Skirt Multicyl (Tigerstop),Assembly,10479,02/22/2024,"5. Prod Ongoing, Maint Required",needs new bushing,Closed and Completed,1145,3,Preston,Maintenance,0,03/04/2024 10:00 AM,"Preston Ellexson - 03/12/24  8:16:14 AM: Removed needed parts to replace bushings and guide pins. Cleaned everything while I was there. Got all remounted. Filled the oil reservoir. Replaced bad bolts on die setup. Spray lubed all guide pins and bushings. Tested some parts with Johnny. Machine is running good. | Preston Ellexson - 03/01/24 12:20:49 PM: All the parts finally made it in. I am on other repairs right now, but will get this knocked out next week ASAP. | Preston Ellexson - 02/22/24 10:26:58 AM: Got the quote and sent through today. Order was sent and asked for overnight delivery. I will take this apart next week and get everything swapped out.",[]
