1750,EQ ID 1750,Skirt Multicyl (Tigerstop),Assembly,15708,05/12/2025,1. Prod Stopped,"Multicyle is not working, and production has stopped.",Closed and Completed,0,0.25,Preston,Maintenance,0,05/12/2025 06:30 AM,Preston Ellexson - 05/12/25  5:41:24 AM: Opened the light curtain box and reset error. No change. Unplugged harness from door circuit board. Waited for a minute then plugged back in. Let it start up then hit internal reset switch. Light curtains are working good now. Machine is good to run.,[]
1750,EQ ID 1750,Skirt Multicyl (Tigerstop),Assembly,16021,06/09/2025,"3. Prod Affected, Not Stopped",Boat stripped on Multicyl,Closed and Completed,0,0.5,Dennis Davis,Maintenance,0,06/09/2025 02:00 PM,"Dennis Davis - 06/09/25 12:08:22 PM: I put a longer bolt in it for now but at some point, it may need a nut on the bottom or a HELICOIL insert",[]
1750,EQ ID 1750,Skirt Multicyl (Tigerstop),Assembly,16297,07/07/2025,"3. Prod Affected, Not Stopped",Boat stripped out,Closed and Completed,0,2,Preston,Maintenance,0,07/07/2025 02:30 PM,"Preston Ellexson - 07/08/25  4:11:52 AM: The right bolt hole for the aluminum bar stop was almost completely stripped out. Went to O'Reilys and got a helicoil kit. Drilled out both holes and tapped for the helicoil. The ones I installed are approx. 1/2"" long. I ordered 1"" coils that should be here today. When they arrive, I will swap them out so the entire bolt hole is threaded back to original size. Machine is ready to run. I turned everything back on yesterday before we left. I let Christian know it's good to run.",[]
