1886,EQ ID 1886,PMU 1 Foam Machine,Assembly,1481,05/25/2022,"3. Prod Affected, Not Stopped",Door won't close,Closed and Completed,0,2,Preston,Maintenance,0,05/25/2022 10:00 AM,Preston Ellexson - 05/25/22  7:55:08 AM: The door bushings on top and bottom are trashed. Swapped the door with a brand new one. Tested machine and the foam is looking good. I went ahead and cleaned off a lot of the build-up on the mold in the machine. Cleaned out the ports on it as well. Tested again and foam is good. Set to 100 and let run. I am going to put in a work order for the 2 doors in maintenance that need new bushings.,[]
