1886,EQ ID 1886,PMU 1 Foam Machine,Assembly,2229,08/24/2022,"3. Prod Affected, Not Stopped",Air compressor is out on this foam machine.,Closed and Completed,0,3,Ronnie @ Sealed Air,Maintenance,0,08/25/2022 01:00 PM,"Preston Ellexson - 08/26/22  4:51:07 AM: Ronnie swapped out the compressor. He cleaned many things on the machine, including the track for the mixing block. He kept getting a calendar motor error. He found in the settings something accidentally got changed. It was set for a 24"" head instead of the 20"" ones we use. After that, aside from the fan wind, the machine is good to run.",[]
