1886,EQ ID 1886,PMU 1 Foam Machine,Assembly,3330,11/22/2022,"3. Prod Affected, Not Stopped",Large foam machine not foaming oieces correctly.,Closed and Completed,0,1,Preston/Derek,Maintenance,0,11/22/2022 12:00 PM,Preston Ellexson - 11/23/22  7:30:02 AM: This was actually for the Large Trimline machine. Cleaned the dispenser solution drain. Replaced cloth and scotch brite pad. Reset a few things on the recipe and tested. Machine is running good. | Preston Ellexson - 11/23/22  7:27:36 AM: Replaced calendar motor. Tested machine and everything is working good. Set machine to run.,[]
