1886,EQ ID 1886,PMU 1 Foam Machine,Assembly,5363,04/18/2023,4. Prod Continuing but Affected Equipment stopped,screen is out  on foam machine,Closed and Completed,0,8,Preston,Maintenance,0,04/19/2023 01:00 PM,"Preston Ellexson - 04/20/23  4:51:42 AM: Removed the jaw assembly and brought to maintenance. Took all apart to replace the bearings in the follow roller that feeds from the black rollers. Cleaned all needed and checked all bolts and parts. Got all back together and put on machine. Got warmed up and recipe adjusted. Machine is running good now. | Preston Ellexson - 04/20/23  4:49:23 AM: Tried to calibrate the dispay with no luck. Got a new one sent overnight. Replaced cables and display. Touchscreen isn't reading at all. Mouse works but no touch. Got with Ronnie and tech support. Replaced main 1164GD board. Calibrated display, but now getting a dispenser solution low pressure. Replaced mixing block, tubing assembly, dispenser solution, and cleaned as much as possible. Still getting error because pump for solution isn't operating. Replaced the main board with another new. Everything is working the way it should after calibrating this time. When film feeds, the right side wants to roll back up. | Preston Ellexson - 04/20/23  4:49:18 AM: Tried to calibrate the dispay with no luck. Got a new one sent overnight. Replaced cables and display. Touchscreen isn't reading at all. Mouse works but no touch. Got with Ronnie and tech support. Replaced main 1164GD board. Calibrated display, but now getting a dispenser solution low pressure. Replaced mixing block, tubing assembly, dispenser solution, and cleaned as much as possible. Still getting error because pump for solution isn't operating. Replaced the main board with another new. Everything is working the way it should after calibrating this time. When film feeds, the right side wants to roll back up.",[]
1886,EQ ID 1886,PMU 1 Foam Machine,Assembly,5399,04/21/2023,1. Prod Stopped,MOLD EJECT,Closed and Completed,0,3,Preston/Josh,Maintenance,0,05/08/2023 02:30 PM,"Preston Ellexson - 05/11/23  8:36:29 AM: Swapped compressor pump and all is running good. | Preston Ellexson - 05/01/23 12:00:12 PM: I've replaced the 1164FE board. I replaced the vacuum motor as well. It was shorting to ground, and the brushes and armature were very worn out. The pressure isn't even producing 9psi. I believe the compressor is bad. Ronnie is getting 2 shipped to us ground. I will swap when it arrives and go from there. Wouldn't even calibrate ejection due to pressure issue. Ran a leak test with no issues.",[]
1886,EQ ID 1886,PMU 1 Foam Machine,Assembly,6299,07/05/2023,"3. Prod Affected, Not Stopped",Door will not open,Closed and Completed,0,1,Preston,Maintenance,0,07/05/2023 12:00 PM,Preston Ellexson - 07/05/23  9:57:19 AM: Door pressure was a little low. Adjusted to see if it made a difference. Door still isn't opening every time. You can very lightly assist it when mold is done and it works fine. Replaced the electro magnet on the door and reset the door pressure. Ran 10 with no issues at all. Left machine running. Good so far.,[]
