1928,EQ ID 1928,Pallet Jack,Assembly,12738,08/13/2024,1. Prod Stopped,Lyft jack bushing wheal,Closed and Completed,0,1,Preston,Maintenance,0,08/21/2024 01:00 PM,"Preston Ellexson - 08/22/24  7:27:25 AM: This was on a blue electric high lift jack. We didn't have any casters already on the shelf. We have 2 bad jacks in maintenance though. Removed casters from one of them and swapped the bad one on this jack. Put the other used one on the shelf for backup. Replaced the power cord for the charging unit due to many wear spots. Tested jack when done, and everything is working good. | Preston Ellexson - 08/15/24 12:39:13 PM: Justin got with me on this and had a work order entered. Lift was in PMU cells. I will follow-up tomorrow.",[]
