1944,EQ ID 1944,Large Trimline Foam Machine,Assembly,1830,06/30/2022,"3. Prod Affected, Not Stopped",High Pressure,Closed and Completed,0,2.5,Preston,Maintenance,0,07/01/2022 02:00 PM,"Preston Ellexson - 07/01/22 11:58:17 AM: Machine was getting either high pressure A, B or dispenser solution consistently. I emptied and cleaned dispenser solution and refilled with new. Replaced the tubing assembly. Removed the mixing block head unit. Took to maintenance and disassembled. Cleaned all parts. Replaced o-rings on A and B valves. There were bare spots in the white and green wire. Put electrical tape around them separately. Put all back together and on machine. Tested and machine is working good. Released for production.",[]
