1944,EQ ID 1944,Large Trimline Foam Machine,Assembly,2574,10/13/2022,"3. Prod Affected, Not Stopped",Won't pull bag in,Closed and Completed,0,2,Preston,Maintenance,0,10/13/2022 12:00 PM,"Preston Ellexson - 10/14/22  4:09:47 AM: Took the mold they needed from small trimline and put back in large trimline. I had made adjustments prior to moving. When I turned on large trimline, the recipe was different from what I had just saved it, and ran it as. Cleaned the foam off of the door, etc. Ran and adjusted the mold as it warmed up. Decreased the film length, and lowered the values on step 2, 3, and 4 for film position. After adjusting a little at a time, and the chemicals warmed up, the molds were coming out looking good. Checked the machine after running through lunch and all is good.",[]
1944,EQ ID 1944,Large Trimline Foam Machine,Assembly,3041,10/25/2022,"3. Prod Affected, Not Stopped",Air compessor out,Closed and Completed,0,1.5,Preston,Maintenance,0,10/25/2022 01:00 PM,Preston Ellexson - 10/25/22 11:14:07 AM: Tried to calibrate ejection and run a leak test with no action. Replaced the compressor and all lines/filters with new. Got all wiring tied back in and compressor all plugged in. Tested and machine ran good. Ran 10 on cold with no issues. Machine is running good.,[]
