1979,EQ ID 1979,PMU Rivet Gun #10,Assembly,12726,08/12/2024,4. Prod Continuing but Affected Equipment stopped,not working,Closed and Completed,0,1,Preston,Maintenance,0,08/14/2024 01:00 PM,Preston Ellexson - 08/15/24 12:33:28 PM: Took gun apart and inspected. Mandrel guide in top back of gun was broken. It had fallen down into the piston rod return spring. Got removed and put back together. Pulling head adapter was unthreaded too. Cleaned and put back together with red Loctite. Replaced jaw pusher spring too. Replaced jaws. Had to clean inside of head adapter housing due to burring. Tested with no issues. Popping rivet in one hit.,[]
1979,EQ ID 1979,PMU Rivet Gun #10,Assembly,13121,09/19/2024,6. General Maint,not popping rivet,Closed and Completed,0,0,PSH,Maintenance,0,12/31/2024 12:00 AM,Scott Herbert - 03/18/25  8:58:31 AM: 3/18/25: PSH Closed. Rivet gun repaired.,[]
