1980,EQ ID 1980,PMU Rivet Gun #9,Assembly,1731,06/21/2022,"3. Prod Affected, Not Stopped",will not pull rivet,Closed and Completed,0,0.5,Preston,Maintenance,0,06/21/2022 07:30 AM,Preston Ellexson - 06/21/22  6:02:10 AM: Rivet was stuck in jaws. Took gun apart to make sure everything was tight. It was pretty dry in the housing. I cleaned it out and oiled everything up. Inspected jaws and jaw spring. Everything is good and tight. Tested and it pulled the rivet in 2 hits. Sent back to Chris.,[]
