1980,EQ ID 1980,PMU Rivet Gun #9,Assembly,7844,10/30/2023,"3. Prod Affected, Not Stopped",Will not pull rivet,Closed and Completed,0,0.75,Preston,Maintenance,0,10/30/2023 02:30 AM,"Preston Ellexson - 10/31/23  4:12:17 AM: Took the head off and saw that the bolt for the head adapter to pin into was broken. Removed broken threads and replaced bad part. There is a pretty good air leak when the gun is in operation, but isn't causing them any issues. I told John to have Johnny enter a work order if they want that repaired. We are awaiting new Gesipa guns to hopefully get rid of these.",[]
